		{"id":"node_inference","type":"text","text":"### 1. Inference Agent\n- **役割**: スキルを用いてタスク実行\n- **読込**: `skills/`\n- **書込**: `raw/`（実行トレース）","x":0,"y":0,"width":280,"height":130,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node_maintainer","type":"text","text":"### 2. Wiki Maintainer\n- **役割**: トレースの根本原因分析\n- **読込**: `raw/`\n- **書込**: `wiki/patterns/`, `wiki/logs.md`","x":380,"y":0,"width":300,"height":130,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node_proposer","type":"text","text":"### 3. Skill Proposer\n- **役割**: ReActによるスキル改善案の作成\n- **読込**: `wiki/`, `raw/`, 既存の `skills/`\n- **出力**: スキル更新候補（Candidate）","x":380,"y":240,"width":300,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node_gating","type":"text","text":"### 4. Gating & Rollback\n- **役割**: 検証セットで評価\n- **成功**: `skills/` を正式更新\n- **失敗**: スキルを巻き戻し、差分を `wiki/skill-impact.md` に蓄積","x":0,"y":240,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"1"}
